---

The above does not cover `utils/benchmark/`. That directory carries the official evaluators and
benchmark constants of OpenMask3D (MIT), Open3DIS (BSD 3-Clause, VinAI) and the ScanNet/ScanNet200
benchmark by way of Mask3D (both MIT), included so that every reported number is produced by the
benchmark's own code. Those files remain under their original projects' licences; each names the
source it was taken from.

Open-YOLO3D publishes no licence, so none of its files are included here. Its Replica evaluator and
its two prompt configurations are read from the checkout `OPENYOLO3D_ROOT` points at, which this
repository already requires for that project's masks and ground truth.
